  "title": "The Shadow Race",
  "family": "fiction",
  "category": "two-person rivalry",
  "premise": "Two friends race to get their shadows across a finish mark first, but a movable stage lamp lets each enlarge or shrink their shadow instead of running. They eventually lock the lamp in place and race their hands as shadow animals, ending in a tied nose-touch at the line.",
